OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be mostly dry
OL,6,Fwith sunny periods and only a small
OL,7,Fchance of an odd light shower. Any
OL,8,Fshowers clear by the afternoon when
OL,9,Fhigh cloud will spread northeast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear spells Shetland at first.
OL,13,FOutbreaks of rain and drizzle spread
OL,14,Fnortheast from the late evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FCloudy with light rain and
OL,17,Fdrizzle in the morning. The rain will
OL,18,Fbecome persistent and heavy at times
OL,19,Fduring the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
