OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FShowers, frequent and heavy at times
OL,7,Fpush north Tuesday. These clear to
OL,8,Fleave Wednesday dry and bright for a
OL,9,Ftime. Outbreaks of rain, some heavy,
OL,10,FWednesday night turn showery Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
